15	// rendered as the LLM Markdown report (or --no-llm table). All pure logic
16	// lives in profile.cpp; this file owns the IO: engine resolve, the cfg probe,
17	// the QEMU spawn, objdump/addr2line, and the per-loop symbol lookups.
